---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Security & Data Vault Architecture | EU DPP Provider"
  description="Enterprise security architecture: Zero-knowledge cryptographic proofs, ISO 27001 data centers, eIDAS 2.0 digital seals, and role-based access control."
>
  <div class="py-16 sm:py-24 max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
    
    <div class="text-center max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-16">
      <div class="eyebrow-pill mb-3 mx-auto">Enterprise Cryptography & Trust</div>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-extrabold text-slate-900 tracking-tight leading-tight">
        Data Vault Security & <br class="hidden sm:inline" />
        <span class="text-cyan-600">Zero-Knowledge Architecture</span>
      </h1>
      <p class="mt-4 text-base text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
        Engineered to guarantee trade secret confidentiality, tamper-evident data integrity, and strict eIDAS 2.0 digital signature verification.
      </p>
    </div>

    <div class="space-y-8 text-sm text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
      
      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-cyan-100 text-cyan-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">1</span>
          <span>Zero-Knowledge Proofs (ZKP) for Trade Secret Secrecy</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Our ZKP engine allows upstream battery suppliers and cathode/anode chemical manufacturers to prove compliance with EU carbon footprint thresholds, responsible sourcing rules, and recycled content targets without disclosing proprietary formulas, specific raw material blend percentages, or tier-1 procurement prices.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-green-100 text-green-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">2</span>
          <span>eIDAS 2.0 Qualified Electronic Seals & PAdES Signatures</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-3">
          Every published battery passport payload and Declaration of Conformity dossier is sealed with an EU Qualified Trust Service Provider (QTSP) certificate (e.g. DigiCert EU QSeal / QES), guaranteeing non-repudiation and legal validity across all 27 EU member states.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="neo-surface p-8 sm:p-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-3 flex items-center gap-2">
          <span class="w-7 h-7 rounded-xl bg-amber-100 text-amber-700 flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-xs">3</span>
          <span>Security Operations & Audit Inquiries</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="neo-well p-4 flex items-center justify-between">
          <span class="text-xs font-bold text-slate-900">Security Architecture & Audit Desk</span>
          <a href="mailto:info@eudppprovider.com" class="text-xs font-bold text-cyan-700 hover:text-cyan-800 font-mono">
            info@eudppprovider.com
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</Layout>
